<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/2/msa@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "8" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/2/msa@> .
